{"ID":"20230926171633-01ljurw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926171633-01ljurw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926171633-01ljurw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926171635-luz24fm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926171635-d3qfqxd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926171635-d3qfqxd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:63,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:63\u0026#125;","title":"【白通加猪胆汁汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926171635"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926171635-luz24fm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926171635-luz24fm","updated":"20230926171635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：葱白四茎、干姜一两、附子一枚(生用，去皮，破八片)、人尿五合、猪胆汁一合"}]},{"ID":"20230926171635-hp9yohh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926171635-hp9yohh","updated":"20230926171635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右五味，以水三升，先煮三物，取一升，去滓,纳人尿、猪胆汁，和令相得，分温再服。若无胆汁，亦可用。"}]},{"ID":"20230926171635-d3qfqxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926171635-d3qfqxd","updated":"20230926171635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[11.36] 少阴病，下利，脉微者，与白通汤；利不止，厥逆无脉，干呕烦者，白通加猪胆汁汤主之。服汤后，脉暴出者死，微续者生。"}]}]}